      "program_solution": "(rule!\n  (let* ((obj (crop-to-content g))\n         (mir (flip-lr obj))\n         (h (max (rows obj) (rows mir)))\n         (w (+ (cols obj) 1 (cols mir))))\n    (for*/fold ([out (empty-grid h w 0)])\n               ([r (in-range h)]\n                [c (in-range w)])\n      (let ((v (if (and (< r (rows obj)) (< c (cols obj)))\n                   (at obj r c)\n                   (if (and (< r (rows mir)) (>= c (+ (cols obj) 1)))\n                       (at mir r (- c (+ (cols obj) 1)))\n                       0))))\n        (if (not (= v 0)) (set-cell out r c v) out)))))",
